window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>\"Do I kill her? Or... do I take her to bed, and then, kill her?\"</b></p> <p><b>The Knight</b></p> <p>Valentino is a brutal assassin entangled in a dangerous hunt of cat and mouse. His target, Sade is the queen on this chessboard of darkness and an unexpected twist that turns the game on its head.</p> <p><b>The Queen</b></p> <p>Cloaked in secrets, Sade has the mind of a strategist and the eyes of a cold-blooded killer. She moves with lethal grace and challenges Valentino's every belief, forcing him to confront not just the darkness in his world, but the darkness within himself.</p> <p><b>The King</b></p> <p>Yet, on the other side of the board is Valentino's boss, Gustavo, a ruthless cartel king. His obsession with Sade knows no bounds, and his commands to Valentino are clear: bring her back, at all costs!</p> <p>Dive into this dark, seductive tale where enemies become lovers, and the fight for survival becomes a fight for the heart.</p> <p>Who will win? Who will die?</p>"; 
